Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.77,0:00:13.56,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Laala, another pizza over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:14.41,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:17.65,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Laala, the deluxe pasta is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.65,0:00:19.37,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting, Señorita.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.93,0:00:21.08,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:23.06,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Laala, a pizza over here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.06,0:00:23.84,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:25.13,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We'd like a menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.13,0:00:25.85,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.85,0:00:27.24,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Is my salad done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:28.04,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:32.19,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Laala, isn't it about time you get going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.83,0:00:33.96,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.96,0:00:36.72,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Mom, Dad, can I head to PriPara?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:37.95,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.95,0:00:40.68,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Tira-miss you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.47,0:00:47.11,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'm Manaka Laala, 11 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.11,0:00:49.11,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'm a PriPara idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:53.23,PriPara,,0,0,0,,PriPara is a world of girl's aspirations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.23,0:00:56.87,PriPara,,0,0,0,,At a certain age, young girls who receive PriTickets can attend PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.87,0:00:58.43,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And any of them can be idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.35,0:01:02.18,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Here girls can ascend through the rankings by performing concerts,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.18,0:01:04.05,PriPara,,0,0,0,,and aim to eventually become a Divine Idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.04,0:02:41.01,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I've Started Being an Idol Again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.78,0:02:43.46,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:46.18,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Prism Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.50,0:02:48.57,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, Ms. Meganee!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.57,0:02:49.89,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yes, good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.63,0:03:01.16,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I see you have a lot more PriTickets, Manaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:03.98,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Head Disciplinarian Minami! Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.98,0:03:05.30,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.30,0:03:07.44,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We better get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:09.68,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We have something important to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.68,0:03:11.46,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:18.92,PriPara,,0,0,0,,PriPara change, complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.73,0:03:22.64,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Ah! There's wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:28.64,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Compri-te!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.27,0:03:31.14,PriPara,,0,0,0,,There are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.87,0:03:36.48,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.71,0:03:39.44,PriPara,,0,0,0,,How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.86,0:03:44.14,PriPara,,0,0,0,,They're freebies for the new term.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.41,0:03:46.72,PriPara,,0,0,0,,They're so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.72,0:03:48.16,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'm excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.16,0:03:50.22,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.22,0:03:52.87,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Come on! We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.33,0:04:01.57,PriPara,,0,0,0,,It's SoLaMi SMILE!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.09,0:04:04.97,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Laala, shake my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:06.63,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Mirei, give me your autograph!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.63,0:04:07.68,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.69,0:04:11.11,PriPara,,0,0,0,,They're beary popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:14.04,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The three of them are major-ranked idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:18.62,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And when they got the legendary Paradise Coord to shine, they exploded into super idols!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.62,0:04:21.61,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And of course, their success is all thanks to me, their manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:24.04,PriPara,,0,0,0,,A 10 LDK...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.04,0:04:28.38,PriPara,,0,0,0,,No, a 20 LDK mansion may be within my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:31.81,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'll be living large!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.51,0:04:34.52,PriPara,,0,0,0,,This isn't the time to be daydreaming-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:37.25,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Hey, Laala, Sophy, Mirei!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.70,0:04:38.78,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.78,0:04:41.05,PriPara,,0,0,0,,If you don't get a move on, you'll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:42.97,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I have to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.97,0:04:44.40,PriPara,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:45.58,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We're cheering for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.58,0:04:46.81,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Thanks, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.81,0:04:48.53,PriPara,,0,0,0,,See ya later-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.11,0:04:53.78,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Is this where we're supposed to be-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.78,0:04:54.81,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yes-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.81,0:04:56.21,PriPara,,0,0,0,,So you're here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.21,0:04:56.77,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.77,0:04:57.10,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:04:58.80,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Shion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.80,0:04:59.75,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:01.43,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Reona.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.43,0:05:03.07,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The three of you have wings too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.38,0:05:05.53,PriPara,,0,0,0,,So cute! We match!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.56,0:05:08.31,PriPara,,0,0,0,,So they called you guys, too-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.31,0:05:09.06,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.06,0:05:09.99,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.70,0:05:14.46,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We need the max explanation about \Nwhat happened the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.94,0:05:17.29,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Your teams can't enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.29,0:05:18.42,PriPara,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.62,0:05:19.33,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.62,0:05:20.59,PriPara,,0,0,0,,There's got to be a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:20.41,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Incomprehensible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.25,0:05:22.52,PriPara2,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.41,0:05:21.78,PriPara,,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:25.58,PriPara,,0,0,0,,SoLaMi SMILE, Dressing Pafé,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.58,0:05:28.34,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I have some important information for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.67,0:05:30.05,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Mr. Meganii.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.71,0:05:32.52,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Both teams...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.52,0:05:33.68,PriPara,,0,0,0,,...are being disbanded!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:35.64,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.97,0:05:37.48,PriPara,,0,0,0,,D-Disbanded?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.83,0:05:38.57,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.37,0:05:41.65,PriPara,,0,0,0,,SoLaMi SMILE is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:43.61,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And Dressing Pafé?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.87,0:05:44.65,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:46.17,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.17,0:05:47.28,PriPara,,0,0,0,,This is news to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:49.07,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Lacking details!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.07,0:05:50.74,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I demand an explanation!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.25,0:05:52.45,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The reason is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.45,0:05:53.91,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The reason is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.33,0:05:57.08,PriPara,,0,0,0,,It's rather complicated,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:59.33,PriPara,,0,0,0,,so I'll explain it at a later time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:02.36,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I won't let it happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:05.58,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'll force them to take it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.58,0:06:06.85,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Right, Reona?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.85,0:06:08.24,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.24,0:06:10.09,PriPara,,0,0,0,,If you say so, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.50,0:06:13.49,PriPara,,0,0,0,,It seems we're not the only ones here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.49,0:06:16.63,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're going to fill us all in at the same time-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:18.06,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.41,0:06:20.02,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.75,0:06:22.94,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:24.90,PriPara,,0,0,0,,It's Mr. Meganii!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:27.86,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I see you've all gathered together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.15,0:06:30.72,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Let's start everyone's dream journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:33.33,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'll be your guide on the PriPara Tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.67,0:06:36.57,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Meganii, what's the deal with disbanding us-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.57,0:06:38.41,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We'll never accept it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.69,0:06:41.67,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We want to continue as a team!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:45.46,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I like shellfish, but don't like being shelved!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:46.71,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I second that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.71,0:06:48.67,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I third that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.08,0:06:51.64,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I fully understand your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.30,0:06:56.10,PriPara,,0,0,0,,On this tour, I shall give you a full explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.10,0:06:58.36,PriPara,,0,0,0,,So please come aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.99,0:07:03.21,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Without further ado, let's sail off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.21,0:07:04.37,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.37,0:07:05.52,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Off we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.69,0:07:08.99,PriPara,,0,0,0,,See you later-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.69,0:07:09.01,PriPara2,,0,0,0,,See you later-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:11.95,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Make sure to fill us in later-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:11.95,PriPara2,,0,0,0,,Make sure to fill us in later-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:12.82,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.82,0:07:14.44,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Kuma and Usagi aren't coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.44,0:07:15.34,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.34,0:07:16.91,PriPara,,0,0,0,,It's just Meganii and his accomplice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.31,0:07:21.33,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Ladies, welcome to the PriPara Tour of Dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.14,0:07:25.53,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I shall be your guide, Akai Meganii.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.53,0:07:28.77,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Once again, it is a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.77,0:07:30.80,PriPara,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.10,0:07:33.69,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Just what are you starting-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.69,0:07:37.87,PriPara,,0,0,0,,For those of you still new to PriPara,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.87,0:07:40.15,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I shall give you a tour of PriPara Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:41.80,PriPara,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:54.89,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Now then, nothing's changed with this part of the town,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.89,0:07:59.92,PriPara,,0,0,0,,but now we'll be moving onto PriPara's new area.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.83,0:08:02.96,PriPara,,0,0,0,,New area?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.96,0:08:06.17,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Ladies, please direct your attention to your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:10.01,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Here you have some cute animals grazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.01,0:08:11.47,PriPara,,0,0,0,,They are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.09,0:08:12.22,PriPara2,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:12.22,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Looks delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.70,0:08:14.90,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Please direct your attention to your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.57,0:08:18.23,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The pond you see here is shaped like a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.23,0:08:19.49,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.47,0:08:20.57,PriPara2,,0,0,0,,The gondoliers are so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.49,0:08:21.43,PriPara,,0,0,0,,How romantic!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.57,0:08:21.43,PriPara2,,0,0,0,,I want to go swimming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.93,0:08:25.86,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Up front you can see a stylish outdoor cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:31.05,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Next, please direct your attention to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.83,0:08:34.64,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Whoops, our eyes seem to have met.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.64,0:08:36.20,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Could this be fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.49,0:08:38.95,PriPara,,0,0,0,,{KYAAAAAaaaaa~~~~}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.22,0:08:41.57,PriPara,,0,0,0,,You can probably see this area from Falulu's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.57,0:08:43.85,PriPara,,0,0,0,,This is the new area?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.85,0:08:45.21,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I already knew about it-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.21,0:08:46.18,PriPara,,0,0,0,,No-no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:47.92,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Our destination is up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:52.48,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.42,0:08:58.26,PriPara,,0,0,0,,What's with that building?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.26,0:08:59.79,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.79,0:09:01.72,PriPara,,0,0,0,,It wasn't here before-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.18,0:09:11.84,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Ladies, please pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.49,0:09:17.03,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Passing through this gate will take you to our newly created live stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.03,0:09:19.87,PriPara,,0,0,0,,the PriPara Dream Theatre.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.63,0:09:22.83,PriPara,,0,0,0,,PriPara Dream Theatre?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.05,0:09:24.04,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.04,0:09:27.47,PriPara,,0,0,0,,A special live series will be performed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.47,0:09:28.29,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Its name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.85,0:09:32.00,PriPara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Idol Dream Grand Prix!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:34.52,PriPara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Idol Dream Grand Prix?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.52,0:09:36.62,PriPara,,0,0,0,,It's here because of certain events.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.62,0:09:38.32,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Because of certain events?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.32,0:09:40.72,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I still don't understand a single thing you've said.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.95,0:09:43.87,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Let me explain PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.13,0:09:47.44,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Meganii Monitor, switch on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.32,0:09:53.39,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Along with this event, a new system will be used this year:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.39,0:09:54.90,PriPara,,0,0,0,,the PriPara Dream Parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.90,0:09:56.31,PriPara,,0,0,0,,So pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.88,0:09:56.71,PriPara2,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.31,0:09:57.36,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Totally cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.71,0:09:57.36,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.95,0:10:00.83,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous floats will be paraded around town,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.23,0:10:03.89,PriPara,,0,0,0,,making it PriPara's most spectacular festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.89,0:10:10.25,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And the Dream Team, made up of five members who\N outshine the rest, will ride on the lead float.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.25,0:10:11.62,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Five?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.62,0:10:12.71,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Not three?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.26,0:10:14.17,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Five people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.17,0:10:16.84,PriPara,,0,0,0,,But we've always been in three person teams!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.84,0:10:18.88,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The Dream Team is to be made up of five members.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.47,0:10:23.35,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I am terribly sorry, but it's part of the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.58,0:10:25.10,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:27.56,PriPara,,0,0,0,,So that's why you've disbanded our groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.61,0:10:32.98,PriPara,,0,0,0,,To announce the parade's commencement,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.78,0:10:39.91,PriPara,,0,0,0,,the selected five will ring the Charm Bell of Beginnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.26,0:10:44.87,PriPara,,0,0,0,,It's a legendary PriPara item on par with the Paradise Coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.52,0:10:49.33,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I've also heard that it will grant any wish\N of the ones who ring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:50.49,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.49,0:10:51.75,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Any wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.75,0:10:52.99,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Really-pri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.99,0:10:53.78,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.78,0:10:54.80,PriPara,,0,0,0,,{hehe}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:10:58.67,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.67,0:11:00.59,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Pushuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.00,0:11:01.93,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.51,0:11:04.43,PriPara,,0,0,0,,{laughen}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:05.38,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Question!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.38,0:11:07.89,PriPara,,0,0,0,,How are those five chosen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.12,0:11:09.60,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.34,0:11:16.57,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The five will be chosen in the Idol Dream Grand Prix\N live series that I mentioned earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.15,0:11:20.82,PriPara,,0,0,0,,From amongst the teams that enter,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:26.95,PriPara,,0,0,0,,four times a year a different shinning Dream Team will be nominated for the Grand Prix.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.87,0:11:29.52,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And then at the end of that year,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.52,0:11:33.21,PriPara,,0,0,0,,the Dream Team that wins the Grand Prix...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.00,0:11:38.67,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Those five will be given the parade's leading roles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.97,0:11:42.94,PriPara,,0,0,0,,So we just need to be the ones who shine the brightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.94,0:11:44.64,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Five person teams...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.64,0:11:48.64,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I wonder what a five person concert will feel like.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:52.01,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Why don't we have a simulation?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.01,0:11:57.59,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Meganii is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:01.24,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Laala, would you like to give it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.90,0:12:28.10,PriPara,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:29.43,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.92,0:12:32.17,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.17,0:12:32.82,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.82,0:12:34.55,PriPara,,0,0,0,,It's a wonderful song.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.55,0:12:37.72,PriPara,,0,0,0,,It's a song from the Idol Dream Grand Prix.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.72,0:12:39.00,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Have you memorized it?{ already?}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.00,0:12:39.69,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.03,0:12:44.43,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Then we shall watch from the audience.{Then we shall watch as your audience.}{では 私は皆さんと客席のほうで観せてもらいます｡}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.43,0:12:45.77,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:47.66,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We'll be cheering for you!{We'll cheer for you from the audience!}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:48.44,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:50.87,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, you'll need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.60,0:12:54.37,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Don't forget this Cyalume Charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.39,0:12:57.13,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Cyalume Charm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.98,0:13:04.95,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of {\i1}My Tickets{\i0} for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:07.85,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:15.35,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Laala's new coord is a Lovely-type one full of lace and ribbons, which gives off a springtime feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.35,0:13:16.94,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Dream Heart Race Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.35,0:13:56.61,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Laala multiplied-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.61,0:14:00.31,PriPara,,0,0,0,,It mimics a five person Dream Team concert with the use of holograms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.14,0:14:37.73,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.21,0:14:41.31,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Aim to dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.23,0:14:44.73,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Walk the runway!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:49.24,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And to sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.82,0:14:53.28,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:14:58.55,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.55,0:15:58.97,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Huh? It turned pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.25,0:16:02.81,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Laala, that was a superb live.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.46,0:16:04.77,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Nicely done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.14,0:16:11.94,PriPara,,0,0,0,,That Cyalume Charm symbolizes that you are taking part in the Idol Dream Grand Prix,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.94,0:16:14.25,PriPara,,0,0,0,,so please take good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:17.20,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Um, why did it change colour?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.20,0:16:21.16,PriPara,,0,0,0,,That's your appeal, and the charm reflects that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.79,0:16:24.06,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The colour pink represents "Lovely".
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:28.49,PriPara,,0,0,0,,You increased your Lovely ranking\N with that concert you performed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.01,0:16:33.63,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Also, this data is used when evaluating the Dream Teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.91,0:16:35.40,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.40,0:16:38.56,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And while that concludes my explanation,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:40.35,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I have one final question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:46.22,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Would you ladies be willing to take part\N in the Idol Dream Grand Prix?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:47.39,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.39,0:16:48.02,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.64,0:16:52.29,PriPara,,0,0,0,,This project uses a completely new system.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.29,0:16:55.76,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Divine Idol, Major Idol, Understudy...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:57.99,PriPara,,0,0,0,,All of them will be starting from level one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:17:02.49,PriPara,,0,0,0,,In other words, while this provides a level starting field for everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.27,0:17:05.71,PriPara,,0,0,0,,as only five person teams are allowed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.71,0:17:10.92,PriPara,,0,0,0,,you'll need to make adjustments as things like compatibility\N are more complicated than in three person teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:13.99,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Please take your time to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.43,0:17:22.00,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The stars of the parade will be that five person team.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.00,0:17:24.77,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The Grand Prix Live at the Dream Theatre.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.51,0:17:29.27,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And the Charm Bell of Beginnings that is said to grant wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.71,0:17:31.29,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I want to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.29,0:17:32.48,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I want to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.48,0:17:39.78,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.30,0:17:41.66,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:44.04,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'd also like to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.46,0:17:46.79,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Sturm und Drang! Exactly what I'm looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.79,0:17:49.54,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one fitting for that leading role.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:51.09,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'll also do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.80,0:17:54.48,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Well, it seems like they're letting anyone try.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.48,0:17:56.55,PriPara,,0,0,0,,So I guess I'll do it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.55,0:17:59.66,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I think I'll just keep doing what I've been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.66,0:18:00.51,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.51,0:18:01.97,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.31,0:18:07.05,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Now then, I shall hand these Cyalume Charms out to those who wish to participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.89,0:18:13.62,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Your team will be recognized when all of your Cyalume Charms flash at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.62,0:18:17.40,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Please do your best and search for your destined group!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.40,0:18:19.50,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Destined group, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:21.12,PriPara,,0,0,0,,That sounds kind of romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.51,0:18:25.83,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Who knows. This may lead to the birth of unforeseen teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.83,0:18:27.80,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Unforeseen...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.80,0:18:31.34,PriPara,,0,0,0,,For example, if I teamed up with Shion...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:34.56,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Or I teamed up with Dorothy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.56,0:18:39.17,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Does that mean I could team up with Sophy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.17,0:18:40.76,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Not in a million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.70,0:18:49.79,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Ladies, thank you for riding with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.79,0:18:52.37,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Let's go on another fun journey some day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.37,0:18:55.86,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I wish everyone good luck in their future endeavours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:58.42,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.42,0:18:59.41,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.41,0:19:00.57,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.26,0:19:05.46,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'll be your guide on the PriPara Tour, a dream journey for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:07.43,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Please come aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.54,0:19:13.07,PriPara,,0,0,0,,So he's planning on explaining the system to all idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.07,0:19:15.07,PriPara,,0,0,0,,He's got it pretty rough, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.07,0:19:16.35,PriPara,,0,0,0,,That must take a lot of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.35,0:19:18.39,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Welcome back-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.39,0:19:21.60,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Do you fully understand the new system-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.60,0:19:22.38,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.38,0:19:25.40,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We've all decided to take part in the Grand Prix.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:26.85,PriPara,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.85,0:19:29.12,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Exactly what I'd expect of an idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:31.13,PriPara,,0,0,0,,You're motivated and putting everything into it-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.13,0:19:33.27,PriPara,,0,0,0,,First we need to form a five person team.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.73,0:19:38.13,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We need to quickly find two new members so we can reform SoLaMi Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:38.99,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Capisce.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:40.22,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We'll do the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:41.82,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We'll reform first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.82,0:19:42.95,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We won't lose-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.49,0:19:47.44,PriPara,,0,0,0,,It seems we're missing two people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.12,0:19:51.80,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Gel-lo!{ｼﾞｪﾙﾝ}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:52.58,PriPara,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.10,0:19:56.07,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.07,0:19:59.09,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'm Mikan, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.09,0:20:02.93,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Jelly-jelly Angely!{ｼﾞｪﾙｼﾞｪﾙｴﾝｼﾞｪﾙ～！}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.26,0:20:05.39,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.89,0:20:08.90,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Aroma! Let's get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.43,0:20:13.86,PriPara,,0,0,0,,You lot of fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.86,0:20:16.31,PriPara,,0,0,0,,You dare stand in my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.69,0:20:17.77,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.59,0:20:21.99,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Then feast your eyes on my demonic power!{ならば見るがいい我が悪魔の力を！}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.99,0:20:22.66,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.66,0:20:23.45,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Demonic?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.86,0:20:26.22,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Derodero Derosaimu... {ﾃﾞﾛﾃﾞﾛﾃﾞﾛｻｲﾑ}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:30.41,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!{ﾃﾞｰﾓﾝﾃﾞｰﾓﾝ ﾃﾞﾙﾃﾞﾙﾋﾞｰﾑ！}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.64,0:20:32.87,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.87,0:20:34.43,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Stand aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.25,0:20:36.58,PriPara,,0,0,0,,A path has appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.58,0:20:37.84,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.75,0:20:49.89,PriPara,,0,0,0,,You're Mikan and Aroma, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.89,0:20:51.54,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.54,0:20:52.58,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'm Mikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:54.20,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Mine name is Aroma.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.20,0:20:55.51,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Please come aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.51,0:20:57.88,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Be an angel to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.11,0:21:01.61,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Without further ado, let's sail off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.61,0:21:02.63,PriPara,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Bon voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.63,0:21:04.44,PriPara,,0,0,0,,What's with those two?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.44,0:21:06.36,PriPara,,0,0,0,,They're pretty intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.36,0:21:08.83,PriPara,,0,0,0,,They sure take their roles seriously.{are great actors.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.83,0:21:13.47,PriPara,,0,0,0,,It's said that PriPara is bustling with all types of idols.{ idols that we've yet to meet}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.47,0:21:17.29,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And I shall find the best partners from amongst them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.58,0:21:19.37,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We won't lose{either }-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.37,0:21:20.25,PriPara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.25,0:21:21.71,PriPara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.07,0:21:24.26,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Things have become really exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.26,0:21:27.77,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The Idol Dream Grand Prix sure sounds like a lot of fun!{Alt: I can't wait to take part in the Idol Dream Grand Prix!}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.77,0:21:30.43,PriPara,,0,0,0,,All right, first we need to make our teams!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.43,0:21:31.90,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Let's do our best!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.90,0:21:33.64,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.77,0:23:08.40,PriPara,,0,0,0,,SoLaMi Smile can't reform?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.40,0:23:09.72,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.27,0:23:13.73,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Laala, you are already under my curse.{汝はすでに我が呪いにかかった}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.73,0:23:15.37,PriPara,,0,0,0,,If you become friends with Mikan and Aroma,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.37,0:23:17.32,PriPara,,0,0,0,,you can recieve the blessings of heaven! {天の祝福を受けられる}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.32,0:23:19.96,PriPara,,0,0,0,,A demon and angel? What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.96,0:23:22.63,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Your fate is to serve under us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.63,0:23:25.74,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We'll form a team and aim for the gates of heaven together!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.74,0:23:26.50,PriPara,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.50,0:23:28.76,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Even if you say that... {alt- You say that but...}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.76,0:23:29.66,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.66,0:23:31.78,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Angel and Demon Neko~n.{天使と悪魔ねこぉ～んmaybe just "Angel and Demon Neko~n" since its not a word}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.78,0:23:33.30,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.30,0:23:34.80,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!
